The canonical ping ID for device dev-C's single ping in the TrailPing telemetry ping feed is **`pg-302`**. I've saved it to the local variable `dev_c_ping_id` to anchor dev-C on the pings side for the billing reconcile sheet.

```json
{
  "dev_c_ping_id": "pg-302"
}
```
